      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e1",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_6",
      "quote": "Despite extensive international research evaluating SUD treatment center effectiveness, previous studies suffer from several knowledge gaps that necessitate this systematic review. Firstly, a lack of consensus on standardized international indicators for measuring treatment success has hindered comparisons across studies (9, 10).",
      "reason": "The Introduction describes the current state of knowledge and explicitly enumerates key uncertainties/gaps (lack of standardized indicators, heterogeneous designs, deficient long-term evidence)."
